{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-07-25 16:19:00', 'title': 'IBM BOARD APPROVES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y. , JULY 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE IBM (NYSE: IBM) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.65 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 10, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AUGUST 10, 2022.'}